0 FILE gear-drive.ldr
0 DESCRIPTION Supported 8:24 spur reduction; one input drives a slower reverse output on two retained shafts
0 Supported 8:24 spur reduction; one input drives a slower reverse output on two retained shafts
0 Name: gear-drive.ldr
0 Author: LDraw Nova / Mecha original example
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 // frame: Fixed base and two bearing rails
1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 frame.ldr
0 STEP
0 // input: 8-tooth input shaft
1 16 0 -62 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 input.ldr
0 // output: 24-tooth output shaft; half-tooth phase preserves cross-hole alignment
1 16 40 -62 0 0.991444861374 -0.13052619222 0 0.13052619222 0.991444861374 0 0 0 1 output.ldr
0 NOFILE
0 FILE frame.ldr
0 DESCRIPTION Fixed base, stacked rails, four round bearings and bonded top caps; holes have centres at Y -62 and Z +/-40
0 Fixed base, stacked rails, four round bearings and bonded top caps; holes have centres at Y -62 and Z +/-40
0 Name: frame.ldr
0 Author: LDraw Nova / Mecha original example
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 // base: 6 x 6 base
1 71 20 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3958.dat
0 STEP
0 // rail_-24_-40: 1 x 6 rail bonded across both bearing towers
1 1 20 -24 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3009.dat
0 // rail_-24_40: 1 x 6 rail bonded across both bearing towers
1 1 20 -24 40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3009.dat
0 STEP
0 // rail_-48_-40: 1 x 6 rail bonded across both bearing towers
1 1 20 -48 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3009.dat
0 // rail_-48_40: 1 x 6 rail bonded across both bearing towers
1 1 20 -48 40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3009.dat
0 STEP
0 // bearing_0_-40: Round bearing; axle may rotate, hole centre is Y + 10
1 1 0 -72 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3700.dat
0 // bearing_40_-40: Round bearing; axle may rotate, hole centre is Y + 10
1 1 40 -72 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3700.dat
0 // bearing_0_40: Round bearing; axle may rotate, hole centre is Y + 10
1 1 0 -72 40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3700.dat
0 // bearing_40_40: Round bearing; axle may rotate, hole centre is Y + 10
1 1 40 -72 40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3700.dat
0 STEP
0 // cap_-40: 1 x 6 cap binds the two bearing bricks
1 1 20 -80 -40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3666.dat
0 // cap_40: 1 x 6 cap binds the two bearing bricks
1 1 20 -80 40 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3666.dat
0 NOFILE
0 FILE input.ldr
0 DESCRIPTION Rigid shaft with keyed gear, two inner gear stops and two outer retaining bushes
0 Rigid shaft with keyed gear, two inner gear stops and two outer retaining bushes
0 Name: input.ldr
0 Author: LDraw Nova / Mecha original example
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 // axle: 8L keyed shaft along Z
1 0 0 0 0 0 0 -1 0 1 0 1 0 0 3707.dat
0 // gear: Keyed spur gear, tooth midplane Z = 0
1 7 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3647.dat
0 // inner_-15: Half bush retains gear against its 20-LDU hub
1 14 0 0 -15 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 32123a.dat
0 // inner_15: Half bush retains gear against its 20-LDU hub
1 14 0 0 15 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 32123a.dat
0 // outer_-60: Full bush retains shaft outside bearing rail
1 4 0 0 -60 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3713.dat
0 // outer_60: Full bush retains shaft outside bearing rail
1 4 0 0 60 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3713.dat
0 NOFILE
0 FILE output.ldr
0 DESCRIPTION Rigid shaft with keyed gear, two inner gear stops and two outer retaining bushes
